\cf0 \

\f1\b\fs32 To install all 290+ screen savers:
\fs28 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
Just double-click on 
\f2\i\b Install Everything
\f0\i0\b0 .\
\
If it won't open because of your security settings, control-click and 
select 
\f2\i\b Open
\f3\b0  
\f0\i0 from the context menu.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs32 \cf0 Where are the screen savers?
\fs28 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
Apple really tries to hide them! In 
\f2\i\b "System Settings", 
\f0\i0\b0 select 
\f2\i\b "Wallpaper", 
\f0\i0\b0 then the 
\f2\i\b "Screen Saver..." 
\f0\i0\b0 button at the top, then scroll 
\f3\i all the way down 
\f0\i0 to the last row that says 
\f2\i\b "Other", 
\f0\i0\b0 and finally, click 
\f2\i\b "Show All (324)". 
\f3\b0 Easy! 
\f0\i0 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs32 \cf0 For best variety:
\fs28 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
Select the screen saver at the bottom of the list that is called 
\f2\i\b "Random XScreenSaver" 
\f0\i0\b0 instead of the built-in one called just 
\f2\i\b "Random" 
\f0\i0\b0 -- you can choose how long a saver should run before a 
new one is selected, and you can un-check the ones that you don't like.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs32 \cf0 To install only some of them:
\fs28 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
Open the 
\f2\i\b "Screen Savers"
\f3\b0  
\f0\i0 folder in this disk image and double-click each saver that you 
want to install. (But that might not work unless you tweak 
\f3\i "System Preferences / Security & Privacy"
\f0\i0  first.  Just do 
\f2\i\b "Install Everything"
\f0\i0\b0 , that's easier.)\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs32 \cf0 To uninstall:
\fs28 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
Open the 
\f2\i\b "/Library/Screen Savers"
\f3\b0  
\f0\i0 folder and drag any unwanted savers to Trash.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs32 \cf0 For more information:
\fs28 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
Please visit the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.jwz.org/xscreensaver/"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 XScreenSaver web site}}. The XScreenSaver collection is free software, and all source code is available there.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

